                    Cancellation policies vary by property and are clearly displayed before booking. 
                    Some properties offer free cancellation up to a certain date, while others may have stricter policies. 
                    Please review the specific cancellation terms for your chosen property before completing your booking.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Refunds will be processed according to the property's cancellation policy and applicable law. 
